<title>INDONESIA: Eight Indonesians killed in Batam landslide.</title>
<headline>Eight Indonesians killed in Batam landslide.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A landslide on the Indonesian island of the Batam killed at least eight people, five from the same family, the official Antara news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Antara said the victims were buried as they slept in their home early on Wednesday in the Bengkong Indah area of the island, 80 kms (50 miles) south of Singapore.</p>
<p>The report said the landslide was caused by heavy rain.</p>
